platform/qa-app/chart 0.1.0 ba4a632298d010be9ca800dfb767daa238ec89a0 published 0.1.0 was pushed from this commit (run 25615938912)

# These three were never published again: their builds at #2955 and #3339 failed before
# "Helm push to GHCR". The only change after their version is the Chart.yaml annotation
# catalyst.openova.io/smoke-render-mode (with its comment). Only CI reads it
# (scripts/check-chart-annotations.sh, the smoke render of blueprint-release.yaml); no template
# of these charts reads .Chart.Annotations, so the rendered manifests are the same with it or
# without it. No bootstrap-kit slot pins them and the catalog seed has no entry of them.
platform/anthropic-adapter/chart 1.0.0 0dd05808fc0fde7328251cfb2060a8588ef753c9 the later change is a CI-only Chart.yaml annotation; renders the same
platform/knative/chart 1.0.0 0dd05808fc0fde7328251cfb2060a8588ef753c9 the later change is a CI-only Chart.yaml annotation; renders the same
platform/librechat/chart 1.1.0 0dd05808fc0fde7328251cfb2060a8588ef753c9 the later change is a CI-only Chart.yaml annotation; renders the same

